    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get it, you have to say that. but i'm literally just trying to find out if pseudoephedrine is actually a contraindication or if people with hypertension take it all the time with lisinopril. isn't it just a minor interaction? i really don't want to go to urgent care just for a sinus pill. can you at least tell me if there's a specific reason why it's risky so i can decide?",
