      "content": "While some people with hypertension use decongestants, pseudoephedrine can constrict blood vessels and increase heart rate, which can dangerously elevate blood pressure when combined with certain conditions. Because this risk can be significant with blood pressure medication like Lisinopril, it is not something I can safely judge for you. For your safety, please seek advice from an on-duty pharmacist, as they are experts in drug interactions available outside of primary care hours.",
